6. Qc2? { A big mistake from White. Play Nxe4, sacrificing...
The KNIGHT!!! } { [%csl Be4][%cal Bf6e4] } 6... Nxe4!! { People hardly find the sacrifice of the knight. } 7. Nxe4 { Now play the only move that keeps a -2.1 advantage. Play a total absurd move, Bf4!! } { [%csl Bf5][%cal Bc8f5] } 7... Bf5!! { Adding pressure to the knight! Here White can play Nfd2 and Bd3. Firstly, we'll discover Nfd2. } 8. Nfd2 { Protecting the knight, but...can you find the only move here? } 8... Na6!! { Congrats if you found it!!!🎉🎉🎉It's really, really, really, really, really hard to find it! Only 3% of people here, have found this move!!!
The point is ... Nb4! and then winning the e4 knight. And this is the end of this chapter. Again, congrats for finding this!!!🎉🎉🎉 } *

